        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Commercial Passage Leversets Brushed Chrome </b>\r\n<p>The GLC were designed for standard to light duty commercial applications.  Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick wood doors. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged with curved lip 2-1/4\" X 1-1/4\" <a href=\"/products/full-lip-strike-plate-global-gla-026-626\">Full Lip Strike Plate</a> (normally used on wood door frames).\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Global Commercial Passage Levers\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable for 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Door Prep: Fits standard 2-1/8\" bore hole</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Standard 2-3/4\", Optional 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Case: Steel, Zinc dichromated resists corrosion, heavy duty spring cage.</li>\r\n<li>Strike:  <a href=\"/products/full-lip-strike-plate-global-gla-026-626\">Full Lip Strike Plate</a></li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\" throw <b>stainless steel</b>.</li>\r\n<li>Handing: Non-handed.</li>\r\n<li>Trim: Empire Levers.</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Chrome</b></li>\r\n<li>Warranty: <b>Lifetime Mechanical</b>. 10 Year on Finish</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<!-- <p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/commercial-door-bore.gif?v=1704354534\" width=\"376\" height=\"240\" border=\"0\" alt=\"commercial door bore hole diagram\">\r\n<br>\r\n<b><font color=\"red\">Warning Note:</font></b> This is a light commercial lever. They are <b>NOT for use</b> on commercial doors prepped  with Thru-bolt holes. (Thru-bolt holes pictured above). If you door has Thru-bolt holes use: <a href=\"/products/standard-commercial-leversets-global-gal-series\"><b> Standard Duty Commercial Levers</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Passage Function (Hall or Closet)(ANSI# F75):</b> For interior doors that don't need locking. Latchbolt operates by lever from either side.\r\n</p>",
